5,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,"We should look at the actual usage and the state of the room before deciding. I want facts, not impressions.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,"I agree. It would be wise to understand how we interact, or rather, how we don't, in this space.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,May,,Let's make sure we aren't just creating more chores for ourselves. I'm curious about where the time actually goes.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,Rationality first. I want to see the financial impact of our current inefficiency and what the alternatives cost.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Servas,,Peace and quiet are precious. I believe we should examine the physical environment and the noise that leaks through.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Jonathan, what specifically are you looking for regarding our interactions?","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"I am interested in where our necessary, yet difficult, conversations take place.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,May,,"I'll be looking into the logistics. I don't want any ""hidden"" hours of labor.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,I'm simply looking for the numbers. It's the only way to make a decision that doesn't bite us later.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Servas,,I wish to see if the mess is as pervasive as it feels.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
