60,3,1,talk,Ryuji,,I vote for the Meeting Space. It's the most fair and manageable.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Jonathan,,I also vote for the Meeting Space. We need a place for the conversations we cannot have at our desks.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,May,,I'll go with the Meeting Space. I'm not looking forward to being the one cleaning a shared fridge again.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Shunichi,,Meeting Space. The ROI on the fit-out is clear when you look at the outside hire invoices.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Servas,,I agree. The Meeting Space provides the structure and privacy we are currently missing.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
